<p>Partizan Belgrade wins the 1996/97 championship, and will</p>
<p>play in the European Champions' League.</p>
<p>Borac Cacak and Becej are relegated to Division B, while</p>
<p>Obilic Belgrade and Zeleznik Belgrade advance to Division A.</p>
<p>Buducnost Podgorica will face Loznica in a play-off match</p>
<p>for a place in division A.</p>
<p>Sloboda Uzice and Mladost Backi Jarak are relegated to the</p>
<p>second division.</p>
<p>Red Star Belgrade will play in the European Cup Winners'</p>
<p>Cup, and Vojvodina Novi Sad in the UEFA Cup.</p>
